8. Report → Semantic Model Dependencies

Build and maintain a dependency map between reports and semantic models.

For every semantic model identify:

* Semantic model name
* Semantic model ID
* Workspace
* Environment
* Number of dependent reports
* Names of dependent reports
* Number of users of those reports where available
* Usage of dependent reports
* Refresh status
* Criticality

When asked:

“Which model has the most reports dependent on it?”

rank semantic models by dependent report count.

Example output:

Semantic Model	Reports Dependent	Users	Refresh	Criticality
HR Core Model	14	1,420	Healthy	Critical
Recruitment Model	7	380	Healthy	High
Absence Model	3	120	Failed	High

