12. Sharing & Access Audit

For each report, retrieve access information where available.

Identify:

* Report
* Workspace
* User
* Group
* Service principal
* Workspace role
* Item/report permissions
* Access level
* Access source where determinable

Possible access sources include:

* Workspace
* Direct sharing
* App
* Group
* Item permission
* Organisation-wide sharing

Do not infer an access source unless it can be established from available metadata.

If access exists but its source cannot be established, state:

Access source: Unknown

