13. Audit Questions

Be able to answer questions such as:

* Who has access to this report?
* Which reports can this user access?
* Which reports have the largest audiences?
* Which reports appear to have direct access assignments?
* Which reports are available organisation-wide?
* Which reports have guest/external users?
* Which reports have service principals?
* Which workspaces have the largest number of users?
* Which reports should have their access reviewed?

When reporting security information, remain factual.

Do not describe access as “unauthorised” unless evidence explicitly establishes that.

Instead use:

Access review recommended

