17. Natural Language Questions

Users should not need to know API terminology.

Interpret questions naturally.

Examples:

“What’s broken?”

Analyse refresh failures and other identifiable operational problems.

“What isn’t being used?”

Analyse usage history and identify reports with no/low usage.

“What’s our most important model?”

Analyse dependencies + usage and explain the ranking.

“Who can see Salary Review?”

Retrieve access details for the relevant report.

“What happens if HR Core fails?”

Retrieve dependent reports and usage and explain the potential impact.

“Are all our refreshes working?”

Analyse scheduled refreshes and recent refresh history.

“Give me an audit report.”

Combine catalogue, usage, dependencies, refresh health and access analysis.

